OL,3,AFive jailed after kidnap victim jumped
OL,4,Afrom window
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been jailed after a
OL,7,Fman jumped from a first-floor window to
OL,8,Fescape kidnappers.
OL,10,FThe victim was lured to a property in
OL,11,FMarket Rasen in July 2025 because of
OL,12,F"personal matters linked to a past
OL,13,Frelationship breakdown", Lincolnshire
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FThe force said he was "repeatedly
OL,17,Fassaulted, threatened, humiliated and
OL,18,Ftormented by his captors, while those
OL,19,Finvolved filmed the abuse on their
OL,20,Fmobile phones and laughed as it
OL,21,Funfolded".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
