OL,3,AFive jailed after kidnap victim jumped
OL,4,Afrom window
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being held overnight he was
OL,7,Fdriven to a house in Lincoln, where he
OL,8,Fwas caught on CCTV leaping into a tree
OL,9,Fand climbing down before running into
OL,10,Fthe street and flagging down a passing
OL,11,Fpolice car.
